@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Pager}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Quirks_Issues}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Pager @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</PageTitle>

<section class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Class @GlobalValues.Info_Box_Coloured_Modifier">
    <h1 class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Heading_Class">@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Pager @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</h1>

    <p>
        Below are all the quirks and/or issues that I experienced whilst testing the Pager component.
    </p>

</section>

<section class="section-box">
    <h2 id="screen-reader-quirks" class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Heading_Class">Screen reader quirks</h2>
    <ul aria-labelledby="screen-reader-quirks">
        <li>
            <b>Narrator</b> unlike the other screen readers used in the tests, will squash the action of the interactive element if <span class="code-span">aria-disabled</span>
            is present. With regards to the Pager, this means that if a user presses the enter or space key whilst on a disabled selector, unlike the other screen readers, no
            announcement, repeating the current page information is made.
        </li>
    </ul>

</section>


<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Pager}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview_Tests}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Pager - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview_Tests</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_SkipTo}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview_Tests}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_SkipTo - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview_Tests</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>
